	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["083FB4B9F92803CB"]
			description: [
				"alright, a lot of people have opinions on create."
				""
				"some people like it, some people don't."
				""
				"the bad news (for h8rs): create and a couple addons &oare&r in this pack."
				""
				"the good news: it is entirely optional, and integrated with gregtech such that you pretty much aren't missing out on anything if you don't use it."
				""
				"IN FACT! it's very closely integrated with GT (see nxt page)"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"this modpack utilizes a mod called Greate. greate is a mod that integrates create with GT very closely. what this means:"
				"- machines in create use stress tiers (ULS, LS, MS, HS) which are analogous to GT's voltage tiers"
				"- shafts of a given tier can only carry so much stress, and linking them up to setups using more than they can carry causes them to overstress"
				"- applicable create machines mirror the recipes of corresponding GT recipe types (press/bender, saw/cutter, mixer/mixer, etc)"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"this means that, if you really prefer create, you can get away with a LOT of using create over gregtech."
				""
				"it also means if you #fuckinghate create that you can literally just... not touch it"
				""
				"have it your way king"
			]
			icon: "create:cogwheel"
			id: "2D130E154B94B575"
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 0.75d
			subtitle: "and it's about Create."
			tasks: [{
				id: "7FCEEB0C85E1E77B"
				title: "we need to talk"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
